                                             Structural Optimal Jacobian Accumulation and Minimum Edge
                                                   Count are NP-Complete Under Vertex Elimination
                                                Matthias Bentert1 , Alex Crane2 , Pål Grønås Drange1 , Yosuke Mizutani2 , and
