The first bare oracle call is still reasoning on the 180-vertex instance. The harness is controlling vendor choice, seeds, retries, and transcript writing; I’m not modifying its evidence or scoring.
diff --git a/results/2506.17521/gen_2506_17521.py b/results/2506.17521/gen_2506_17521.py
