+"""Verified generator for Structural Optimal Jacobian Accumulation.
+
+The family uses the exact Vertex Cover gadget in Section 3, Theorem 1 of
+arXiv:2506.17521.  A cover is sampled by first sampling its independent-set
+complement, a cubic source graph is built around it, and the theorem's
+four-phase total vertex-elimination sequence is carried into the resulting
+computational DAG.  Verification compiles any candidate cover and replays the
+eliminations with exact integer graph operations.
+
+There are no import-time side effects and the implementation is standard-
+library-only.  ``gvlib`` is made available when the repository helper package
+is present, but this finite graph family does not require it.
+"""
