codex
I found a viable correction to the draft: keep the paper’s exact Vertex Cover→Jacobian-elimination theorem, but plant the independent-set complement as two translated exponent cosets in \(\mathbb F_p^\*\). This makes the family honestly Track B: the public algebraic decoder is \(O(n)\) and short after the invariant is recognized, while generic cover search and elimination-order search remain mechanical. I’m replacing the unsupported Track A claim and will require the decoder to be reported as the successful reference algorithm.
